Package: maps
Type: Package
Title: Hierarchical Geographic Maps with Sea-Distance Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("John", "Gavin", email = "john@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Draws hierarchical administrative boundary maps for EU countries
    (countries, provinces, counties, districts, parishes) using giscoR and
    osmdata. Computes sea-distance metrics via spatial adjacency graphs.
    Includes an interactive Quarto dashboard deployed to GitHub Pages.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
